67: {% data reusables.profile.org_settings %}
68: {% data reusables.organizations.settings-sidebar-actions-general %}
69: 1. Under "Runners," use the dropdown menu to choose your preferred setting:
70:    * **All repositories** - self-hosted runners can be used for any repository in your organization.
71:    * **Selected repositories** - self-hosted runners can only be used for the repositories you select.
72:    * **Disabled** - self-hosted runners cannot be created at the repository level.
73: 1. If you choose **Selected repositories**:
74:    1. Click {% octicon "gear" aria-label="Select repositories" %}.
75:    1. Select the check boxes for the repositories for which you want to allow self-hosted runners.
76:    1. Click **Select repositories**.
