140: ### Preventing {% data variables.product.prodname_actions %} from creating or approving pull requests
141: 
142: {% data reusables.actions.workflow-pr-approval-permissions-intro %}
143: 
144: By default, when you create a new organization, workflows are not allowed to create or approve pull requests.
145: 
